msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: verify-iso-sig\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: \n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-08-27 18:35+0200\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-07-30 16:10+0200\n"
